        "title": "The chart below shows the number of people employed in five types of work in one region of Australia in 2001 and 2008. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QuRcdTh5doFhSmxnL5OluISmgsx\"><strong><em>The chart below shows the number of people employed in five types of work in one region of Australia in 2001 and 2008.</em></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MTIad6L52oUYB5xP4gnlpBCYgoh\"><strong><em>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and </em><em>make</em><em> comparisons where relevant.</em></strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Employment in Australia: 2001 vs 2008</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KQezdJH83oe3pTxLzR8lESEOgbQ\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Employment in Australia: 2001 vs 2008 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả số lượng c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n trong năm loại nghề nghiệp tại một khu vực ở &Uacute;c v&agrave;o năm 2001 v&agrave; 2008.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0XfdVtsIoSgYrxcwF0lAxMWgYd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Employment in Australia: 2001 vs 2008 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: số lượng c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n - 5 loại c&ocirc;ng việc - ở một v&ugrave;ng ở &Uacute;c.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PES6dseoLobP1kxm8GSljpAcgZe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GyMMdvAcso0IJ5x56zGlzhnYgih\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JuOUdRLncoReoExIbwdlf47agoC\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Phần lớn c&aacute;c ng&agrave;nh nghề thay đổi &iacute;t, Computing tăng đ&aacute;ng kể nhất, Farming giảm mạnh</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XYRldd0ZjoVJWvxdzPvlM4NKgrg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Số lượng nh&acirc;n c&ocirc;ng trong ng&agrave;nh Sales lu&ocirc;n cao nhất</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZKeidNvRUomf1bx5BFDlwhvEgTf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZKeidNvRUomf1bx5BFDlwhvEgTf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ag5CdNVfXoWE9IxqVyIlRycXgSy\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GHgadt7wZomLlLx1mVKlwK2Ugsd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Sales v&agrave; Accounting</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WGoqdQcWtoHsDGx75CllMli9gvh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C19ZdoUEGoF9aGxPs7AlV9aQgyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2001 </strong><em>(Số lượng nh&acirc;n c&ocirc;ng trong ng&agrave;nh sales l&agrave; 150,000 người, </em><em><strong>gấp đ&ocirc;i</strong></em><em> nh&acirc;n c&ocirc;ng của ng&agrave;nh accounting ở mức 65,000 người)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WQ59dQkyooQusBxhW5IlVcifgHg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2008 </strong><em>(Lượng người l&agrave;m sales </em><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em><em> 10,000 người, </em><em>trong khi</em><em> nh&acirc;n c&ocirc;ng trong lĩnh vực accounting </em><em><strong>giảm nhẹ</strong></em><em> 5,000 người)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ejc6dy9xgoCTiZxU3D0ll8ggg4J\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMAGdlHtOoSFpCx9IcOlPJTJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Anild0KgDodr4CxaGVxlsOo5g9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XAkiduKvHok7iZxgPrrlvDobgre\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Computing, Nursing, v&agrave; Farming</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XAkiduKvHok7iZxgPrrlvDobgre\">\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BIzZduw96oBX03xdW9xlWCoCgNh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vf9FdQpZOoI7iwxTqlAlgbfUgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2001 của computing v&agrave; nursing </strong><em>(Số lượng nh&acirc;n c&ocirc;ng trong ng&agrave;nh computing and nursing </em><em>tương đồng</em><em>, ở mức 55,000 người)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dt7cd6v65oHWphxSTe1lOq37gyg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2008 của computing v&agrave; nursing </strong><em>(Lượng người l&agrave;m computing </em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 75,000 người, </em><em>trong khi</em><em> nh&acirc;n c&ocirc;ng trong lĩnh vực nursing </em><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em><em> 5,000 người)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SpsJdhjkQorbKbxN2dDln6D9gMd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của farming</strong> <em>(C&oacute; số nh&acirc;n c&ocirc;ng &iacute;t nhất, ở mức 25,000 người, v&agrave;o năm 2001, v&agrave; sau đ&oacute; </em><em><strong>giảm</strong></em><em> 10,000 người v&agrave;o năm 2008)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MCTSdfVoroHeaZxLkfllocxrgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BmTtdXNagopEUsx1367lc99SgjZ\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>c&ocirc;ng việc</strong>\", thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>jobs</strong>\", m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>occupations</strong>\" để c&acirc;u văn của m&igrave;nh đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BmTtdXNagopEUsx1367lc99SgjZ\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JiU4d7WyFo7WyVxyZvXlCSLGgdc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O40Pdwy5vojNsgxM4fIl4yTRgjd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The bar chart illustrates the number of workers in five different <strong>occupations</strong> in an Australian region in 2001 and 2008.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 371,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgYOdAwi2oDRI4x4bObl2oLxgsb\">The bar chart illustrates the number of workers in five different occupations in an Australian region in 2001 and 2008.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13780,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 372,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OPI8d9wiloEiftxndnpl5BuEg2e\">Overall, while most sectors experienced relatively minor changes in employment figures over the seven-year period, there was a notable increase in Computing jobs and a significant decline in Farming positions. In addition, Sales remained the dominant sector throughout the period, with substantially higher numbers than all other occupations.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13780,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 373,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xb1ZdX6xRo0dUZxnCKHljcFYgex\">Looking at the two largest employment sectors, Sales had approximately 150,000 workers in 2001, which was more than double the figure for Accounting at around 65,000. By 2008, while the number of people working in Sales saw a slight increase of about 10,000, the Accounting sector experienced a minor decline of roughly 5,000 workers.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13780,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 374,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZC6fdPJBvomhPMxgg4QltHAwg7b\">Regarding the remaining occupations, Computing and Nursing employed similar numbers of around 55,000 people in 2001. While the Computing sector grew considerably to about 75,000 workers by 2008, the Nursing sector showed only a modest rise of approximately 5,000. Finally, Farming, which had the lowest employment figure of about 25,000 in 2001, saw this number decrease by roughly 10,000 by the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13780,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
